{"number":102,"nameArabic":"التكاثر","nameSimple":"At-Takathur","nameEnglish":"The Rivalry in world increase","revelationPlace":"makkah","ayahCount":8,"bismillahPre":true,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"ar":"أَلهىٰكُمُ التَّكاثُرُ","tj":"أَلْهَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>تَّكَاثُرُ <span class=end>١</span>","en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"},{"n":2,"ar":"حَتّىٰ زُرتُمُ المَقابِرَ","tj":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَقَابِرَ <span class=end>٢</span>","en":"Until you visit the graveyards."},{"n":3,"ar":"كَلّا سَوفَ تَعلَمونَ","tj":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣</span>","en":"No! You are going to know."},{"n":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ كَلّا سَوفَ تَعلَمونَ","tj":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤</span>","en":"Then no! You are going to know."},{"n":5,"ar":"كَلّا لَو تَعلَمونَ عِلمَ اليَقينِ","tj":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْيَق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٥</span>","en":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty..."},{"n":6,"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ الجَحيمَ","tj":"لَتَرَوُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجَح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مَ <span class=end>٦</span>","en":"You will surely see the Hellfire."},{"n":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّها عَينَ اليَقينِ","tj":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ لَتَرَوُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهَا عَيْنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْيَق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٧</span>","en":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty."},{"n":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتُسـَٔلُنَّ يَومَئِذٍ عَنِ النَّعيمِ","tj":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ لَتُسْــَٔلُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>٨</span>","en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure."}]}